  message: "Shipped in PR #3419 (commit da94238c9) per the locked plan. Both surfaces addressed: (1) Surface 1 pre-Scenario-B verification gate (_pre_scenario_b_gate in forgejo-api.sh) catches merged-during-timeout via _check_pr_merged and about-to-merge-poll-flake via mergeable+single poll_ci retry with 120s backoff, before close-and-repush. (2) Surface 2 post-rebase poll-and-merge as a labeled while-loop with rebase_max iter cap (replacing the previous one-shot + Recovery: hint). No new external CLI deps — internal composition of existing forgejo-api.sh helpers. Validation criterion (verbatim from human): 'the next auto-pr invocation that traverses the rebase-then-merge path completes without emitting Recovery: and merges to dev.' Will be exercised organically by the next concurrent-tracker-sync ship; flip to satisfied at that point."  # fe93
